  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You use ki to harness your rage into a powerful force.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13, Raging Chakra, base attack bonus +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain fast healing while using Raging Chakra. You regain a number of hit points at the end of your turn equal to the number of ki points expended in this chakra.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
